 All paths in `config\gateway.toml` are resolved relative to the gateway root,
 so each copied deployment keeps an independent workspace, thread state, and log.
 
+On Windows, the generic `command = "codex"` follows the validated
+`%LOCALAPPDATA%\OpenAI\Codex-Windows-SSH\current.version` selection when that
+installation exists; otherwise it uses PATH. No release number is configured.
+At each App Server start, desktop-generated node_repl/notify paths for this
+installation are rebased to the same runtime using process-local CLI overrides.
+Global Codex configuration, credentials, custom tools, and permissions are not
+rewritten. Explicit custom executable commands remain respected. Restart the
+gateway after a desktop runtime update to release the previous runtime files.
+
